Project Planning Phase
# ComicCraft-AI: Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

 ## Project Design Phase

 ### 1\. Introduction

 The **Project Design Phase** defines the overall architecture, modules, data flow, user interface, database structure, and AI integration of **ComicCraft-AI**.

 The system is designed as an AI-assisted comic creation platform where users can provide a simple story idea and use **Google Gemini models** to develop it into a structured comic containing characters, scenes, dialogues, and panels.

---

